---
description: Compare the competency's required decision steps with those elicited by an adapted scenario.
args: { kernels: CompetencyKernel[]; scenarios: AdaptedScenario[] }
returns: ComplexityComparison[]
---
For every required decision, identify its observable prompt, learner action, tradeoff and consequence in the adapted scenario. Record any missing step and the source supporting equivalence. Unknown or unsupported mappings remain blockers for review.
